flowchart TD
    ENTRY --> NormalizeInput
    NormalizeInput --> IntentDetection
    IntentDetection --> IntentConfidenceGate

    IntentConfidenceGate -->|low| ClarificationFlow --> ResponseFormatter --> END
    IntentConfidenceGate -->|high| EntityExtraction

    EntityExtraction --> DomainValidation
    DomainValidation --> IntentRouter

    IntentRouter --> ProcurementFlow
    IntentRouter --> DNSFlow
    IntentRouter --> NameserverFlow
    IntentRouter --> TransferFlow
    IntentRouter --> OwnershipFlow
    IntentRouter --> URLRedirectFlow
    IntentRouter --> SubdomainRejectFlow
    IntentRouter --> GeneralInquiryFlow

    ProcurementFlow --> DomainRegistryLookupTool
    ProcurementFlow --> ServiceNowTicketTool
    ProcurementFlow --> ResponseFormatter

    DNSFlow --> DNSProviderLookupTool
    DNSFlow --> ResponseFormatter

    NameserverFlow --> DomainRegistryLookupTool
    NameserverFlow --> ResponseFormatter

    TransferFlow --> DomainRegistryLookupTool
    TransferFlow --> ServiceNowTicketTool
    TransferFlow --> ResponseFormatter

    OwnershipFlow --> DomainRegistryLookupTool
    OwnershipFlow --> ResponseFormatter

    URLRedirectFlow --> DomainRegistryLookupTool
    URLRedirectFlow --> ResponseFormatter

    SubdomainRejectFlow --> DNSProviderLookupTool
    SubdomainRejectFlow --> ResponseFormatter

    GeneralInquiryFlow --> KnowledgeLookupTool
    GeneralInquiryFlow --> ResponseFormatter

    ResponseFormatter --> END